name = "The Treasury of Loyal Retainers"
blurb = "This series depicts scenes from the famous puppet (and later kabuki) play about 47 Ronin (masterless samurai) avenging their master, Asano Naganori, a fictionalized account of a 1703 Akō incident.

Hokusai published these works under the name Shunrō."
